====================================================================================================
FACTOR-2 RESOLUTION: which clean 'sector-style' event equals g* = {maxgap > 2/7} (THM-527)?
====================================================================================================
EV1_emptycell = a fully empty 1/7-sector        (>= 1/7 hole, the route's natural scale)
EV2_arc>2/7   = an empty OPEN 2/7 arc = {maxgap > 2/7} EXACTLY (def of circular maxgap)
EV3_adj       = two cyclically-adjacent empty 1/7-sectors
G2            = maxgap > 2/7  (THM-527 good).   G1 = maxgap > 1/7.

EXPECTED IDENTITIES:
  G2 == EV2_emptyarc2_7_gt   (tautology: maxgap>2/7 <=> an open empty 2/7 arc exists)
  G2  => EV1_emptycell       (open >2/7 interval contains a full closed 1/7 cell)
  G1 == EV1-ish but at 1/7   (one missed sector ~ a >1/7 hole)

